Narrative:
As a user
I want to test the main functionality of Demowebshop
So that I can ensure the e-shop works correctly

Scenario: 1. Verify user registration is possible
Given I am on main application page
When I click on element located by `xpath(//a[@class='ico-register'])`
When I click on element located by `xpath(//input[@id='gender-female'])`
When I enter `Test` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id='FirstName'])`
When I enter `User` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id='LastName'])`
When I enter `test_user_${generate-random-uuid}@test.com` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id='Email'])`
When I enter `Password123` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id='Password'])`
When I enter `Password123` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id='ConfirmPassword'])`
When I click on element located by `xpath(//input[@id='register-button'])`
When I wait until element located by `xpath(//div[@class='result' and contains(text(), 'Your registration completed')])` appears

